description: Standard directory and file structure for Fiotech Orbis Frontend project (Next.js + ShadCN)
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

## 🏗️ Root Structure

```bash
.
├── app/                  # Next.js App Router pages & layouts
│   ├── (app)/            # Routes that require authentication
│   ├── (public)/         # Routes that do not require authentication
│   ├── layout.tsx        # Root layout
│   └── page.tsx          # Landing or main page
│
├── components/           # Shared and reusable React components
│   ├── common/           # Reusable composite components (AppSidebar, SiteHeader, ...)
│   ├── features/         # 
│   ├── layout/           # Application-level layouts (DashboardLayout, AuthLayout, ...)
│   └── ui/               # Basic Shadcn UI components (button, input, card, ...)
```
